          "path": "_m/w/s/n/3/ludao-lighthouse-wp/green-island-lighthouse-2.jpg",
          "filename": "Green Island Lighthouse-2.jpg",
          "caption": "Green Island Lighthouse\nThe Ludao Lighthouse, built in the 27th year of the Republic of China (1938), is located on the northwest coast of Ludao Township, Taitung County. The tower is a round reinforced concrete structure. The old name of Green Island is the only place to go to the southeastern Taiwan Sea and the Pacific Ocean. Due to the dense rocky reefs on the green island and the wreck of ships, the \"Hoover President\" cruise ship sank in the Republic of China in 26 years. The matter. When the \"Hoover President\" shipwreck occurred, more than 1,000 tourists were rescued by the residents of Green Island. The American Red Cross Society thanked the Green Island residents for their courage to save people. It was donated in the memorial service of the following year. Green Island Lighthouse.",
          "alt": "Green Island Lighthouse\nThe Ludao Lighthouse, built in the 27th year of the Republic of China (1938), is located on the northwest coast of Ludao Township, Taitung County. The tower is a round reinforced concrete structure. The old name of Green Island is the only place to go to the southeastern Taiwan Sea and the Pacific Ocean. Due to the dense rocky reefs on the green island and the wreck of ships, the \"Hoover President\" cruise ship sank in the Republic of China in 26 years. The matter. When the \"Hoover President\" shipwreck occurred, more than 1,000 tourists were rescued by the residents of Green Island. The American Red Cross Society thanked the Green Island residents for their courage to save people. It was donated in the memorial service of the following year. Green Island Lighthouse.",
          "width": 2368,
